1
00:00:00,619 --> 00:00:02,549
(Leonard:)Mm, this one comes with
music and flowers.

2
00:00:02,621 --> 00:00:05,991
(Leonard:)Oh, they even stream the whole
thing live on the Internet.

3
00:00:06,058 --> 00:00:07,428
(Penny:)Why would we want that?

4
00:00:07,493 --> 00:00:09,823
'Cause there's a lot
of gorgeous blondes out there

5
00:00:09,895 --> 00:00:12,595
(Leonard:)who don't believe they can land
a short, nearsighted scientist.

6
00:00:12,664 --> 00:00:15,134
(Leonard:)Let's give them hope.

7
00:00:15,199 --> 00:00:16,769
(Penny:)Whatever. Put us
on the Internet.

8
00:00:16,834 --> 00:00:19,674
(Penny:)I've always wanted a wedding
with a comment section.

9
00:00:19,737 --> 00:00:23,977
I-If you're not into this,
we can do it another time.

10
00:00:24,042 --> 00:00:25,342
(Penny:)No. No, I want to.

11
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:27,510
(Penny:)Look, we've put this
off long enough.

12
00:00:27,578 --> 00:00:29,008
(Penny:)Let's do it.
Aw.

13
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:32,220
(Leonard:)That's exactly what you said the
first time we slept together.

14
00:00:32,283 --> 00:00:33,713
(ringtone playing)

15
00:00:33,784 --> 00:00:35,614
(Leonard:)Oh, excuse me.

16
00:00:35,686 --> 00:00:36,856
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

17
00:00:36,921 --> 00:00:38,051
(Leonard:)Hey.

18
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:39,991
(Sheldon:)Leonard, have you
gotten married yet?

19
00:00:40,057 --> 00:00:41,157
(Leonard:)No. Why?

20
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:42,894
Good. Don't do it!
Why not?

21
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:45,229
(Sheldon:)Some important new information
has come to light.

22
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:48,235
(Sheldon:)Women are the worst.

23
00:00:48,298 --> 00:00:50,128
(Sheldon:)I thought it was paper cuts,
but I was wrong.

24
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,000
(Sheldon:)No piece of paper
ever cut me this deep.

25
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,770
(Leonard:)What happened now?

26
00:00:54,837 --> 00:00:58,207
(Sheldon:)Amy has ended our relationship.

27
00:00:58,275 --> 00:00:59,545
(Leonard:)Oh, no. Seriously?

28
00:00:59,609 --> 00:01:00,309
(Penny:)What's going on?

